  "foaf:name": "The Corais de Alagoas Project",
  "sdo:name": "The Corais de Alagoas Project",
  "sdo:description": "The Corais de Alagoas Project promotes coral reef conservation, awareness, and restoration along the northeastern coast of Brazil. Designed by marine scientists and the State Secretariat for Tourism of the state of Alagoas, the project combines ecological monitoring, research-based restoration planning, and community engagement. It strengthens capacity development by training early-career scientists, involving local tourism operators, and increasing public understanding of reef ecosystems. Through strong cross-sectoral partnerships, Corais de Alagoas contributes to the goals of the UN Ocean Decade and Brazil’s marine policy frameworks.",
